from regipy.registry import RegistryHive
h=RegistryHive('work/extracted/sd8ee02/SOFTWARE')
for path in [r'Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall', r'Wow6432Node\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Uninstall']:
    try:
        k=h.find_key(path)
        print('KEY',path)
        for sk in k.iter_subkeys():
            vals={v.name:v.value for v in sk.iter_values()}
            disp=vals.get('DisplayName') or vals.get('QuietDisplayName')
            if disp:
                print('-',disp,'|',vals.get('Publisher'),'|',vals.get('InstallDate'),'|',vals.get('DisplayVersion'))
    except Exception as e:
        print('ERR',path,e)
